.TH L10N-LINT 1 "2026-02-15" "Daniel Nylander" "l10n-lint Manual"
.SH NAME
l10n-lint - Linter for localization files
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B l10n-lint
.RI [ OPTIONS ]
.RI [ PATHS... ]
.SH DESCRIPTION
\fBl10n-lint\fR is a linter and validator for translation files (.po, .ts, .xliff). It checks for missing translations, fuzzy entries, placeholder mismatches, typography issues, HTML tag validation, keyboard accelerator mismatches, and quality problems. Available as both CLI and GTK4/Adwaita GUI. Supports GitHub repo scanning without cloning and localized output in 45+ languages.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.BR \-g ", " \-\-github " " \fIREPO\fR
GitHub repository (owner/repo or URL) to scan.
.TP
.BR \-p ", " \-\-path " " \fIPATH\fR
Path filter for GitHub repos.
.TP
.BR \-f ", " \-\-format " " \fIFORMAT\fR
Output format: text, json, html, github (default: text).
.TP
.BR \-o ", " \-\-output " " \fIFILE\fR
Save report to file.
.TP
.BR \-\-max\-length " " \fIN\fR
Maximum translation length (default: 500).
.TP
.B \-\-no\-recursive
Do not search subdirectories.
.TP
.B \-\-strict
Treat warnings as errors.
.TP
.BR \-q ", " \-\-quiet
Show only summary.
.TP
.B \-\-check
Exit code only, no output (for CI).
.TP
.B \-\-skip\-fuzzy
Ignore fuzzy warnings.
.TP
.BR \-V ", " \-\-verbose
Show detailed progress.
.TP
.BR \-G ", " \-\-gtk
Launch GTK graphical interface.
.TP
.BR \-v ", " \-\-version
Show version number and exit.
.SH EXAMPLES
.nf
l10n-lint translations/
l10n-lint -g yeager/ubuntu-l10n
l10n-lint --format json -o report.json *.po
l10n-lint --strict --check src/
.fi
.SH FILES
.TP
.I ~/.config/l10n-lint/
Configuration files.
.TP
.I ~/.cache/l10n-lint/
Cached data.
.SH BUGS
Report bugs at https://github.com/yeager/l10n-lint/issues
